### GET all appointments
GET http://localhost:8080/api/appointments/getAll
Accept: application/json

### GET appointments by email
GET http://localhost:8080/api/appointments/get/kevin.hu@sjsu.edu
Accept: application/json

### POST create appointment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/appointments/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "app_id": "random1231321312312",
  "server_id": "server_id213131312213",
  "service_id": "svc-nginx",
  "email": "kevin.hu@sjsu.edu",
  "status": "PENDING",
  "created_at": "2026-03-11",
